WEBVTT

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.160
Even so, that's surprising.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:10.320
We Musicians often come here ourselves,

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.080
but I never would've thought this is a key 
location for returning to the real world.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:15.830
Yeah.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.910
Some of my power's returned 
since μ fell asleep

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.550
and her influence over Mobius waned.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:28.040
So then, at one point you also 
possessed the same power as μ?

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.920
Well yeah, though I'm still 
not back in perfect condition.

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:36.930
I'm finally able to sense 
that location, though.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:39.510
The door at the top of this tower, you mean?

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:43.230
Yes. The Door of Judgment.

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:46.510
Isn't that just a simple entrance 
to the room the Musicians are using

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:48.020
as their headquarters?

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:52.810
No. Your base is outside this Miyabi City.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:54.490
Outside Miyabi City?

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.920
The Door of Judgment is the sole portal

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:01.820
capable of passage between Mobius and 
the space outside. In other words...

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:04.750
That door also connects to the real world?!

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:05.330
Yes!

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:09.130
Then that means we can return to 
the real world through that door!

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:12.210
Well, that's not actually true.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.010
The only ones capable of linking 
the Door of Judgment to reality

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:21.800
are the scant few able to access the 
deeply stored data that composes Mobius.

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:23.870
Meaning μ?

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:25.600
If μ cooperates with us,

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:29.420
then we can use that door to 
return you all to the real world!

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:32.900
That doesn't sound like something 
we can really count on.

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.360
That's not true!

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:38.540
Earlier, μ was just confused 
about all that's happened!

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:41.740
Once she gets good rest, 
recovers, and hears us out,

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:45.580
then I'm sure she'll go back to 
the kind μ she's always been.

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:49.520
Though the Musicians are 
gathering here tonight as well.

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:51.390
Before we can talk to μ...

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:54.090
We're not going to be able 
to avoid fighting them.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.310
All right!

00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:58.550
Let's settle this! Today!

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:34.760
We're finally going to 
return to reality, huh?

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:39.200
Kotaro-sempai, have you already decided 
what you're going to do when you get back?

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.440
Well...

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:42.320
Rescue Man, right?

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.540
No! Not that!

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:47.720
What about you, anyway?

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:48.810
Me?

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.410
Probably be a novelist.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.650
Huh? Can you write novels?

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:56.460
I don't know.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.800
But I want to try.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.100
I want to read them.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:02.300
Thanks.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.360
And you, Izuru-sempai?

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.510
Live on my own.

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.640
That's kind of boring.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:11.560
Shogo-sempai, are you all right?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:12.940
It's nothing.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:16.140
What?!

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:17.560
What's wrong?

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.500
I can hear the cries of their hearts!

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:27.930
It's that cry from before!

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.580
Aria! Where's it coming from?!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.710
Uh... the 18th floor, east side.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:35.210
Hey! Hold on!

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:36.670
Kotaro-kun?!

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:48.140
Stop it!

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:48.840
Here?!

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:49.850
Just make it stop already!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:51.220
What are you guys doing?!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.700
These spiky bastards...

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:35.050
Hey, you okay?

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.740
Yeah, you saved me.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.590
Where am I?

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:40.810
Landmark Tower.

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:44.540
Huh? But Landmark Tower's...

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:49.870
Hey, what's wrong?

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:50.740
Get a grip!

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:54.200
It's him! It's him!

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.330
Hey!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.940
Are you getting in my way?

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.210
Then I'll need to eliminate you as well.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.460
You're a Musician?!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.930
I am the guardian of hell, 
commander of darkness.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.480
Argh, jeez!

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.360
This is irritating!

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:27.120
It's taking too long, you know!

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:29.030
Be quiet, Wicked.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.440
We should just finish them off at once.

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:35.460
I'll wreck them for you.

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.140
That lack of patience is a problem.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:43.320
It will be time to use your power soon.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:45.280
Until then, bear with it.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:48.070
I finally get to play!

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:50.880
However, that one man you 
are not to lay hands on.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:51.590
Huh?

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:56.430
Satake Shogo, he's my prey.

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:58.250
Hey.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:01.710
Hey, Shogo-sempai, are you listening?

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:02.900
Yeah.

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:05.280
We need to go after Kotaro-sempai.

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:09.610
Ahh, jeez, why does he go running off 
on his own even at times like this?!

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:13.220
Hey, what are we going to do, President?

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:19.120
Let's hurry.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:19.850
Huh?!

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:21.420
What are you saying?

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:24.130
Kotaro should understand.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:27.550
Our top priority is returning to reality.

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:29.710
I know it is, but...

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:32.470
Aren't you being a little cold?

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:39.850
Ah, again!

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.640
<i>Please let me go! Please!</i>

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:46.320
These are all voices of 
people crying out for help!

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:46.320
<i>Someone! Anyone!</i>

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.220
Do we go help them?

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:53.280
Or do we abandon them and go on ahead?

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:57.320
Well, well, that's a 
difficult choice to make.

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:03.330
I can't.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:07.930
Suzuna!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.750
Hey, Suzuna-chan!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.720
Oh well.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:16.720
I just hope this isn't 
a trap set by the Musicians.

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:17.600
Huh?

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:19.890
That couldn't possibly be true, right?

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:27.730
Where the hell did he go?

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:30.910
I am the one who lurks in shadows.

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:33.740
Imperceivable by normal men.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.610
I believe I told you it's futile.

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:52.260
Give up. Someone like you...

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.220
I'm not giving up!

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:00.400
No matter what happens!

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:02.510
If someone's in trouble, I'll save them!

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:05.140
I'll never give up on them!

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:08.730
And you claim that is your justice?

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:10.410
Of course it is!

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:14.360
Over there!

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:22.590
This is...

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:24.870
They forced her to eat rotten food.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:28.260
I'm going to untie you now, so 
please hold on a little longer.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:29.470
This is his doing, without a doubt.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:45.340
You'll be rust on my blade.

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:47.640
Shadow Knife, right?

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.280
I knew it.

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:51.660
That outfit, that manner of speaking...

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:55.610
It's Shadow Knife, the anime hero, right?

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:59.560
You admired heroes and 
wanted to become one,

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:01.120
so you came to Mobius, didn't you?

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:06.080
In that case, why are you 
doing things like this?

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:08.230
You're supposed to be a hero!

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:11.260
So why are you tormenting the weak?!

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:15.010
You don't understand anything.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:17.550
You're the only thing I don't understand.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:19.800
You managed to become a hero, right?

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.300
So why are you using your power for this?

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.810
You're the one I'll never forgive!

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.200
Shadow Knife...

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:36.120
Here in Mobius, he obtained the same 
powers as the anime character

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:38.920
and took to torturing those he doesn't like.

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:41.480
But I'm shocked that he 
was this cruel about it.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:46.660
Hey, get a grip!

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.320
Grit your teeth!

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:53.040
I'm going to beat that rotten 
personality of yours back into shape!

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:58.710
Listen, I do understand

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:01.010
what it feels like to be the victim.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.510
No matter how much you beg for help...

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:05.800
No matter how loud you scream...

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:07.420
It never reaches anyone!

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:10.520
I bet you don't understand that.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:13.230
What it feels like to be bullied!

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:24.060
Where did he go?!

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:27.120
H-Hey, is someone there?!

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.830
O-Over here! Hurry!

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.750
Help me, hurry!

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:33.210
I'm coming!

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:42.180
Hey, are you all right?

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:44.430
Yeah, I know!

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:45.530
I know!

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:47.010
It was my fault, all of it!

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.330
Get a grip!

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:49.670
You're fine now!

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:52.120
I remembered it all.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.460
So, please forgive me!

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.440
Do you mean...

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:58.480
Did you regain your memories 
of the real world?!

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.250
It was him!

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.610
He did this!

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:12.200
Shadow Knife...

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:13.080
You...

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.460
You're Yamada!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.640
I know it!

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:18.250
You're holding a damn grudge 
over what happened in the past!

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:19.960
What do you mean?

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.100
That guy...

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.500
In short, he was the one who got bullied.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:24.200
Huh?

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:27.970
There's always at least one person 
like that in every class, right?

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:31.420
But he's held onto those 
old encounters forever.

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:33.160
How can he be Shadow Knife?!

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:34.880
Pretending he's a damn hero!

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.440
H-Hey...

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:40.040
Did you bully him back in the real world?

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:44.150
<i>Born into an imperfect life,</i>

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.620
I wouldn't say bullied.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.150
I just teased him on occasion!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.440
In other words,

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:48.400
<i>where divine punishment awaits,</i>

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:49.130
you've been forcing those who 
bullied you in the real world

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:52.990
<i>I've cast aside my pathetic self.</i>

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:52.120
to regain their memories and experience 
the same torment they put you through?

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:55.900
The weak can be saved only by punishing evil.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:59.100
<i>Now pay the price for staining me red.</i>

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:59.100
That's the truth I've learned first hand.

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:00.750
Shut up, Yamada!

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:05.800
<i>I'll take those ugly, violent weekends</i>

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.630
You're too persistent, 
following us all the way here!

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:05.800
Even if you all thought 
you were just teasing him,

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:13.950
<i>and erase them from here completely.</i>

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:09.220
it's hell for the one 
on the receiving end.

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:11.640
Wh-What?

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:14.410
Besides, that's way past 
the statute of limitations!

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:18.500
There is no statute of 
limitations on mental trauma!

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:18.810
<i>If everything I look up to in this world</i>

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:23.930
<i>can be saved right now with God's power,</i>

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.760
Huh?!

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:22.970
I don't get you at all!

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:28.620
Since you spoke of how it feels to be 
bullied, then you should understand.

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:27.360
<i>then let me fill that role myself.</i>

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:35.660
<i>Now let's bring the hammer 
of justice down here.</i>

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:34.220
The actions I take here 
are the path of justice.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:36.260
Hold on.

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:38.830
That doesn't just mean you 
can torment them back.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:43.090
Crimes should be met with 
fitting punishments. Right?

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:46.490
<i>The sins in that place without a breeze...</i>

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:45.280
Those who contributed to bullying...

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:47.760
Those who watched and pretended 
it wasn't happening...

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:50.940
<i>the sins of those jet black egotists...</i>

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.210
They all...

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:53.680
If you help them, then they'll 
just do the same thing again!

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:55.440
<i>Know those sins cannot be forgiven.</i>

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:57.900
No, I'm saving those in trouble.

00:13:55.440 --> 00:14:01.610
<i>Now pay the price for staining me black.</i>

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:02.380
Did you truly believe that 
what you were doing was just?

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:08.280
<i>Allow me to secretly show you,</i>

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:05.320
You aided evil, which means...

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:09.990
You are evil as well.

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:16.620
<i>this blade that follows karma.</i>

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:13.160
Your shallow justice is hypocrisy!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.410
Self-deceit!

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:22.260
Kotaro!

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:24.360
Kotaro-sempai!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:29.680
Now, that's enough time 
spent playing friends.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:33.180
Regret your decision when you're in hell.

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:39.440
I-I can't hold back anymore!

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.410
Wicked?!

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.310
Why now?!

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:54.910
<b>Even if something has already happened, 
you can still choose what you do.</b>

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:01.350
Is everyone all right?

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.070
Yes, somehow.

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:05.250
Kotaro!

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:13.390
Shadow Knife!

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:18.940
I... I am Shadow Knife, defender of justice.

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.410
I won't...

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:21.520
I won't...

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.810
Grab my hand! Hurry!

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:26.990
I punished evil.

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:31.240
I inflicted many times more 
suffering than I received.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.750
Shadow Knife!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:34.200
They, too...

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:38.080
had big bodies like you and 
acted all proud as they...

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.150
No! I...

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:42.000
No...

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:44.940
Why is this happening to me?

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:46.040
Yamada!

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:48.580
It's just the same in the end.

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:52.950
If those in the real world are shit, 
then so are the ones in here.

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:57.850
Help... me...

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.500
Stop that already.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.880
He's not dead, right?

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:32.800
You're not able to die here in Mobius, right?

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:35.450
I can't sense him anymore.

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:39.140
B-But he's okay in the real world, right?

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:42.230
His real body wouldn't die, right?

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:45.630
If you lose your life here in Mobius,

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:47.610
then the real version goes as well...

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:50.570
No way...

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:53.030
You mean...

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.010
It's possible that we might have died, too?!

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:58.860
Huh?! I never heard anything about this!

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:01.490
Aria, did you know?

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:05.210
That Mobius was such a dangerous place?

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.620
Well...

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.750
Ichika...

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:21.540
Why are you so afraid?

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.170
You!

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:26.150
You haven't changed, not since long ago.

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:28.980
You were always, yes...

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:32.440
Ichika, not again!

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:34.540
What a pathetic man.

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:54.760
What is this?

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:58.460
There's no one here.

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:06.910
I thought we were going 
to be able to return home.

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:08.810
You were, but...

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:13.320
Without μ, this door won't 
lead to the real world, right?

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:18.980
Then, you think those guys knew 
we were coming today?

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:21.110
I get that feeling, too.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:24.980
Which means there's someone 
who ratted us out to them.

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:27.370
Was it you, Kensuke?!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.970
I saw that coming.

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:30.090
You're the only one possible!

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:32.240
Stop that, Kotaro!

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.250
But...

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:38.220
It's true that someone among us had 
to share that information, right?

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:42.680
Even after I told you not to.

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:45.010
Wicked, you're a hopeless child.

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:50.520
But now we can settle everything.

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:57.110
They're unable to trust each other anymore.

00:18:58.680 --> 00:19:01.040
Well, I'm leaving.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.120
Me, too.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.950
Where did the president go?

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.890
I don't know.

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:08.580
Maybe he went home ahead of us.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:19:59.960
<b>Messages</b>

00:19:58.250 --> 00:19:59.960
<b>You have a new message.</b>

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:15.290
What the heck?

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.520
Naruko called us out, 
and she's still not here?

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:20.740
What do you think this is about?

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:23.740
Regardless, it's awfully sudden.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.800
I can't believe μ would approach us.

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:28.280
Shogo, what's going on here?

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.040
Why are you asking me?

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:33.000
You were the one who called us here, right?

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:35.250
Saying you got a message from μ...

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:38.640
Me? No, I heard from Kensuke.

00:20:38.640 --> 00:20:39.960
Huh? Me?

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:43.600
Huh? I got a message that we 
were having another hot pot.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:44.720
Sorry!

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.800
I'm late!

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:50.110
Hey, Naruko! Are you the one behind this?

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:51.210
What?

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:53.140
Sending fake messages to everyone.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.600
What?!

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:59.480
It's more like she also received 
a message from someone else.

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:02.040
What's this?

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:03.960
I never sent anything like this.

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:05.510
Me neither.

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:08.310
So everyone's been summoned here 
by different fake messages?

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:10.790
Who on earth would do this?

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:14.950
I'm going home.

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:20.810
Huh? What?

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:22.460
It won't open.

00:21:27.860 --> 00:21:28.590
Damn!

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:29.930
It won't budge!

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:32.000
We've been locked in here?

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:34.100
We've fallen for their trap.

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:35.440
Damn it!

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:38.480
This means there really is 
a traitor in our midst!

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:39.940
No way...

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:44.280
Someone had to have leaked information

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:46.840
back during the night at 
Landmark Tower, right?

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:48.910
Huh? Speaking of which...

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:51.620
Hey, where's the president?

00:23:27.240 --> 00:23:30.720
It's finally our turn!

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:33.150
Mamia, Cuticle, Soushiro,

00:23:33.150 --> 00:23:34.850
Yabami, Activate, Nya!

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:37.880
Final Episode: Caligula!

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:40.260
It's not the final episode.
